  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/Rh3qGv5/image-2022-12-22-203652108.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1128\" height=\"493\"><br><span style=\"color:#f60\"><strong>關於：</strong></span></p>\n<p>本模組在不新增任何單一物品的情况下，改善了<strong>原版遊戲體驗</strong>。包含<strong>40 多種結構</strong>遍布世界各地（包括下界和終界），從簡單的結構到<strong>莊園</strong>、<strong>村莊</strong>和<strong>地牢</strong>。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fqra\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/909ede20-4a30-4179-aa0c-b22cfb57c687.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"900\" height=\"142\"></strong></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f90\"><strong>示例：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f90\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/b9QYgWN.png\" width=\"366\" height=\"200\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#000\"><strong>（在任何生物羣系中生成，只要抬頭看看就好 :)）</strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#000\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/jpMVOgB.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"366\" height=\"199\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><strong>（在黑暗森林中自然生成，你不會錯過它的，相信我）</strong></p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/bQsssEZ.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"369\" height=\"201\"></strong></p>\n<p><strong>（稀有的地下結構，由友好的村民居住）</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/rRy93VQ.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"363\" height=\"199\"></strong></p>\n<p><strong>（快速有趣的地牢體驗，頂部有一個小頭目）</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f60\"><strong>更多圖片請參見「圖片」部分，劇透太多會無聊的 :)）</strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#930\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f60\"><strong><span style=\"color:#000\">如果你有任何建築想法，或者只是想找點樂子，歡迎<a href=\"https://discord.gg/J8RVuVhbP4\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#fc0\">加入我的</span></a></span><a href=\"https://discord.gg/J8RVuVhbP4\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#fc0\">Discord！</span></a></strong></span></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"color:#f60\"><strong>致謝：</strong></span></span></strong></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmcreator.net%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"color:#f60\"><strong>MCreator：</strong></span></span></strong></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmcreator.net%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"color:#f60\"><strong><span style=\"color:#000\">讓这一切成為可能</span></strong></span></span></strong></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>精選視頻：</p>\n<p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/T6hq4sBT3tw?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/iUMQf3hI5_4?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/IOk8Q_EcTXM?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"color:#f60\"><strong><span style=\"color:#000\">&nbsp;</span></strong></span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/jiRxy8-2yC4?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"color:#f60\"><strong><span style=\"color:#000\">我的其他項目<span style=\"color:#f90\">！</span></span></strong></span></span></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/structuresplus\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/267/271/64/64/637235123831811521.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"118\" height=\"118\">Structures Plus (1.12)</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/undiscovered-technologies\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/361/988/64/64/637528164696327536.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"117\" height=\"117\">Undiscovered Technologies <span style=\"color:#f90\">（關於未知技術模組的整合包）</span></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f00\">也歡迎在你的整合包或視頻中使用此模組</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f00\">只是不要將其上傳到第三方網站，謝謝 :)）</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"color:#f00\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>",
